	(text "Sink only: 5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2 (ODD JOBS 25): Default USB power, 500 mA. ESD at the connector (119): TPD2E2U06 on D+/D-, SMF15A on VBUS. Shell to GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 105.41 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "76428a8f-48fc-5cfc-b7c1-171c494f8031")
	)
	(text "(plastic enclosure, 26). The 22R series resistors sit at the module (compute sheet). VBUS_SENSE 100k/150k (5.0 V -> 3.0 V, 0 uA without USB) drives"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 107.95 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "32aff6f6-dcd5-5783-95b6-c91252d166eb")
	)
	(text "the gate of Q102: its drain is USB_PRESENT_N, active low, with a 100k pull-up to +3V3 (R123, 33 uA only while USB is present), on the RTC pad GPIO2,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c781a36d-2e06-5eb7-bd85-b7cda9887368")
	)
	(text "so plugging USB wakes A1 from deep sleep (ext1 any-low; design review 2026-10-06). 2N7002: VGS(th) 2.5 V max at 250 uA against >= 2.85 V of gate at"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "91350691-634b-561b-9819-92818d6b1701")
	)
	(text "the USB minimum 4.75 V; VGS 20 V max, so a faulty source up to 33 V leaves the gate intact."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 115.57 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1 1))
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9e5d48d1-a7b9-5572-8d72-504fad57bf00")
	)
